{"title":"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A sequence of six shapes repeats to form the following pattern:\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>(image needed: circle, rectangle, pentagon, star, octagon, triangle, circle, rectangle, pentagon, star, octagon, triangle, ...)<br />\nWhat is the 55<sup>th</sup> shape of the pattern?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/9/b79030abeb688469b5ffc2e1c4e37fee225a529e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/d/a0dd2916129187d79107b7402923943a52dfb413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\times 9 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />) has a remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> when divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/9/b79030abeb688469b5ffc2e1c4e37fee225a529e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /><sup>th</sup> shape of the pattern must be the same as the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /><sup>st</sup> shape of the pattern. This would be the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/c/52c91be2a4cb68c27873f6e1195ceeff5dcadb93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{circle}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"51\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC\">2021 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%